<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.3400 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.3400 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.3400 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Thursday after 75.4200 on Wednesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     June 26		 June 25</p>
<p> High			     75.5000		 75.4500</p>
<p> Low				75.3400		 75.4000</p>
<p> Open			     75.5000		 75.4000</p>
<p> Close			    75.3400		 75.4200</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  3.965		   1.150</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
